# This repository is public and must never contain data from a real tenant. Anything the app or
# the tests could write from a live tenant is kept out by pattern as well as by design: tenant
# profiles, caches, change logs and test settings belong in the OS app-data folder, not here.
*.log
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.har
appsettings.*.local.json
tenant*.local.json
testsettings*.json
